WEBVTT

00:03:52.625 --> 00:04:15.011
(Music)

00:04:15.011 --> 00:04:20.995
It's so simple, so evocative.

00:04:20.995 --> 00:04:23.855
So many emotions seem to be inside of it.

00:04:23.855 --> 00:04:25.583
Yet, of course, like all music,

00:04:25.583 --> 00:04:28.042
it's essentially not about anything.

00:04:28.042 --> 00:04:31.825
It's just a design of pitches and silence and time.